<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to prohibit unqualified individuals from
acting as hairdressers; to amend the <legref refid="act-1962-043" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Shops and Industries Act
1962</i></name></legref>; and for other purposes.</txt></block></tier>
