<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_4012bf8f-512e-4d9f-9b39-5498c0ce283e"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref refid="act-2003-062"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Hairdressers
Act 2003</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_10778849-c876-4db0-adf3-8a88c027bf47"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_f391c2f4-ae07-4302-bf6f-95f5a3a35887"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b0ac7b9a-07cc-43c5-ae95-5260c1f50f51"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_9fe0be14-37a9-4c4c-b2e1-da8582021ecd"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Hairdressers must be qualified</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_17397407-4349-4215-8c46-b1b27a482db0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_9af9943c-22ec-4845-a17d-7377ecddc946"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Hairdressers must be qualified</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An individual must not act as a hairdresser for
fee, gain or reward unless the individual is qualified to act as a
hairdresser.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.3-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6c1ba3bd-192e-4ccf-85d0-c41b07f87697"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty&#8212;20 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_af5025fe-a264-4fe7-8408-54aab008a673"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_a2b38bf0-c4bb-482a-a10c-795577adb1e2"
id="sec.4-he"><b>When is an individual &#8220;qualified to act as a
hairdresser&#8221;?</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bbe8c03a-80bb-4cf3-8894-a8e7f33e57fa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of this Act, an individual is
<defterm type="definition" guid="_b0d9f72c-2684-4506-8893-c69c506f3b4a"
id="sec.4-def.qualifiedtoactasahairdresser"><b><i>qualified to act as a
hairdresser</i></b></defterm> if any one or more of the following applies to
the individual&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_337c7df4-2d27-46eb-ab60-728d137c1d80" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the individual has been awarded an authorised
qualification by a registered training organisation,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7419a155-3954-4d3e-ade6-da4e1719c428" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b"
status="repealed">
<no>(b)</no>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>
</li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_094c83f4-f66e-4252-97ac-5412c8caa19f" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a determination has been made under section 37 of
the <legref refid="act-2001-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Apprenticeship and Traineeship Act 2001</i></name></legref>
that the individual is adequately trained to pursue the recognised trade
vocation of hairdressing (because the individual has acquired the competencies
of the recognised trade vocation),</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_90eae929-569d-4719-8fa8-239b5893a833" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the individual has at any time held, or been
taken to have held, a licence under Part 6 (Regulation of the hairdressing
trade) of the <legref refid="act-1962-043" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Shops and Industries Act
1962</i></name></legref>, other than a licence limited to carrying out beauty
treatment only.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a7f7e383-2472-4831-bb94-54ef45e0762c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_eae0cc3e-1a91-4c8d-b767-dda77dfb2733"
id="sec.4-def.authorisedqualification"><b><i>authorised
qualification</i></b></defterm> means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a84b7e58-0e19-4c39-bab2-9885549a0b1d" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the set of nationally endorsed standards and
qualifications for recognising and assessing skills known as
&#8220;Certificate III in Hairdressing&#8221;, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_440ad613-6861-4c33-9807-d1d0bedc5681" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Certificate III in Hairdressing is no
longer nationally endorsed, the qualifications prescribed by the
regulations.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_2eda532a-03c0-4216-8cd8-82af7614f105"
id="sec.4-def.registeredtrainingorganisation"><b><i>registered training
organisation</i></b></defterm> has the same meaning as in the <legref
jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>National
Vocational Education and Training Regulator Act 2011</i></name></legref> of
the Commonwealth.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 2005 No 100,
Sch 3.8 [1] [2]; 2013 No 95, Sch 9.4; 2017 No 22, Sch 2.17 [1] [2]; 2017 No
42, Sch 2.4; 2018 No 25, Sch 6.</txt></content>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d99091c3-64cf-4df6-8c06-91b54adb0c24"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_0d08a810-af8f-4b19-8622-ed1e0826c3ed"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b0a885f1-5f2a-48ac-a810-9e57898dee68"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_b37058b3-9bfd-4d90-812a-4095382ac7ff"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Prohibition on unqualified hairdressers does not apply to
apprentices, health care professionals or certain others</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 3 does not apply to&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4c3a4dd1-9471-4457-94c9-571d04f5f512" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an apprentice (within the meaning of the <legref
refid="act-2001-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Apprenticeship and Traineeship Act 2001</i></name></legref>)
who acts as a hairdresser when under the direct control and supervision of an
individual who is qualified to act as a hairdresser, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3ab4bb60-ef15-4bd4-947e-21be88901608" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any individual who acts as a hairdresser when
engaged in the practice of his or her profession as a legally qualified
medical practitioner, nurse or physiotherapist or other health care
professional, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4a0c2959-55f8-4c63-ab39-3641c753c53a" id="sec.5-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any individual who acts as a hairdresser when
providing care for elderly or disabled people, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4ca55cf0-fbe7-41c0-8053-19c0eccaac7d" id="sec.5-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any individual who acts as a hairdresser in such
other circumstances as may be prescribed by the
regulations.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_77999b07-d0c8-417f-a4d3-365c60eb1c1e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_beec1296-32e4-48a9-8d64-566eff24e6b0"
id="sec.6-he"><b><legref refid="act-2001-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Apprenticeship and Traineeship Act
2001</i></name></legref> not affected</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The operation of the <legref refid="act-2001-080"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Apprenticeship
and Traineeship Act 2001</i></name></legref> is not affected by this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_409ba38b-e8cf-4259-840d-88155bae32e9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_a11b09d9-17a7-4990-baee-456b86edfeb0"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Information and documents may be
required</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e43e45bc-8246-436d-8f5f-53ea346e2b2b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If an authorised officer has reason to believe
that an individual is acting as a hairdresser but is not qualified to do so,
the authorised officer may serve on that individual a notice requiring the
individual to do either or both of the following for the purpose of
determining whether the individual is in fact qualified&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c6a6c9be-bbf9-418e-b7a3-081e8dc041a6" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to produce specified documents for inspection or
copying at any place nominated in the notice,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5dc12fd6-053b-4981-8cb8-3dd7bcbc1b2b" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to provide the information specified in the
notice.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_583ba6a6-9443-4c2c-b5f0-d3903a246eb0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An individual who, without reasonable excuse,
fails to comply with a notice served on the individual under this section
within the time specified in the notice is guilty of an
offence.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.7-ssec.2-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f170a097-c7d6-420c-b41c-a5f7c8507f12"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty&#8212;20 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b1c82729-ea67-4c6c-afc1-2330b5d9cf83"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_bd87ece7-f8cf-4931-a863-39dc4d69f407"
id="sec.7-def.authorisedofficer"><b><i>authorised officer</i></b></defterm>
means an investigator appointed under section 18 of the <legref
refid="act-1987-068" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Fair Trading Act 1987</i></name></legref> or an officer of a
Government Department who is authorised by the Minister for the purposes of
this section.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7:</b> Am 2019 No 14,
Sch 1.9.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_206d162e-21b6-4a74-8257-097fa4de77d1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_68b7d072-b3b8-4ca3-b437-290567e96ce5"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Proceedings for offences</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6cf010ad-cfd7-4d64-9bc0-7f2515f65b7c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Proceedings for an offence under this Act may be
dealt with summarily before the Local Court.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1662be4a-8c77-4c84-ade9-e2f4966a628a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Proceedings for an offence under this Act may be
instituted only by the Minister or by a person duly authorised by the Minister
in that behalf, either generally or in a particular
case.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 8:</b> Am 2007 No 94,
Sch 2.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
